          }
        ],
        "text": "Arkansas\u2019s Act\u202f900 seeks to regulate PBM reimbursement rates and requires PBMs to allocate margins back to local pharmacies to preserve access in rural communities."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Frederick Liu",
        "citations": [
          {
