            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 61,
              "start": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Seth P. Waxman presented oral argument on behalf of the respondent."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "699224459d84f531d4d1f9b20f538451ac65618843da57e2bd34ba0348f02e33",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-699224459d84-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 61,
              "start": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Thomas asked whether the copay determination, a central plan function, would be controlled by the plan if the pharmacy won its appeal."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "699224459d84f531d4d1f9b20f538451ac65618843da57e2bd34ba0348f02e33",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-699224459d84-0000-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 61,
              "start": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kagan, justice Kagan inquired about the distinction between regulating PBMs and regulating plans, and whether a plan\u2011managed benefit would raise a different question."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "699224459d84f531d4d1f9b20f538451ac65618843da57e2bd34ba0348f02e33",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-699224459d84-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 61,
              "start": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kavanaugh asked a follow\u2011up question seeking clarification of the respondent\u2019s position."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "699224459d84f531d4d1f9b20f538451ac65618843da57e2bd34ba0348f02e33",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-699224459d84-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 61,
              "start": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, justice Gorsuch questioned whether ERISA preemption of the Arkansas law would also preempt other general benefit regulations."
      }
    ],
